      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5cfb491476b5b77800e860ec|full_name}\n\nThat's what I'm trying to suggest here, the ability to block all chatboxes triggered by OSC through Third Party applications, But not block the chatboxes of users typing in them with keyboard/not triggered by Third party OSC programs would still work. \n\nI'm aware I can block people's chatbox. I don't want to go through the hassle of every lobby I join to individually turn off all the users whom are using OSC.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
