  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-06-10T15:42:59.238Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I think it would be a great feature to allow disabling OSC chat boxes for users who interact with it via third-party software through an option in settings, while still permitting messages from users who type manually/Use the chatbox function in-game through the hand radial menu. Right now we cannot disable it, if we do it will also disable the chat boxes of users who are trying to communicate through it. \n\nNowadays, many users display information like time, specs, GPU temperature, CPU temperature, and other unnecessary details that clutter the screen. This feature would help keep cleaner and not having to watch some users clogging up half your screen with unnecessary information.",
